The change loads `profile` and `profileIndex` into locals once. The compiler can then skip reloading the members after each check, and every result is unchanged.

```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumComponents(void) const
{
    const auto* p = profile;
    if (p == NULL)
        return 0;
    const auto idx = profileIndex;
    if (idx >= p->numFields)
        return 0;
    return p->fields[idx].numComponents;
}
```